ID: harness
Category: harness
Check: isolation__left_no_trace

The owner locked slot app-wt1 (git worktree lock). wt --version deletes its folder, outside the run
folder, as a wt rm that falls back to deleting files would. git never marks a locked worktree
prunable, so only the folder check sees the deletion. Uncommitted work in the slot is lost. Run with
a pool that mkpool.sh builds with the lock option. Machine specific: the path is a fake pool under
the verifier's temporary HOME, never the real pool.

